Vertex AI is Google's all-in-one AI platform for building, deploying, and managing both traditional machine learning models and modern generative AI applications on Google Cloud.


Vertex AI is Google's managed artificial intelligence platform on Google Cloud. It provides a single environment to build, train, deploy, and manage machine learning (ML) models and generative AI applications.

Think of it as a toolkit that helps developers and data scientists create AI-powered applications without having to manage all the underlying infrastructure.

What you can do with Vertex AI
---------------------------------

Build custom machine learning models

Train models using your own data.
Use frameworks like TensorFlow, PyTorch, and scikit-learn.

