Example workflow

Suppose you're building a customer support chatbot:

Upload your company documents.

Use Vertex AI with a Gemini model.
Create a chatbot that answers customer questions.
Deploy it as an API.
Monitor usage and improve responses over time.

======

Key components

| Feature          | Purpose                                                 |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
| Model Garden     | Browse and use Google's and third-party AI models       |
| Gemini API       | Access Google's generative AI models                    |
| Vertex AI Studio | Build and test prompts without writing much code        |
| AutoML           | Train models with little or no ML expertise             |
| Pipelines        | Automate ML workflows                                   |
| Vector Search    | Build retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) applications |


