Vertex AI vs. ChatGPT API

| Vertex AI                                                                     | ChatGPT API                                                         |
| ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Runs on Google Cloud                                                          | Runs on OpenAI's platform                                           |
| Access to Gemini models                                                       | Access to GPT models                                                |
| Strong integration with Google Cloud services (BigQuery, Cloud Storage, etc.) | Strong integration with OpenAI ecosystem and many third-party tools |
| Built for end-to-end ML lifecycle as well as generative AI                    | Primarily focused on AI model APIs and assistants                   |


